From: OpenWrt MT6990 repair <mt6990@local>
Subject: [PATCH] pinctrl: mediatek: add MT6990 SDK four-instance EINT map

Port the complete 237-entry AP-EINT coordinate map from the MT6990 SDK.
Entries not enabled by the vendor table use instance 4 as an explicit
sentinel, outside the four real hardware instances.

